      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, definitely sounds more human than what i was expecting. \n\ni'm just a little worried about the score though. looking at it, the tool only gave it a pretty low rating because it didn't use the keywords enough. i know i said not to game it, but if the score is too low, the board might not even bother reading the actual content. \n\ncould you try another version? maybe try to weave those words in a bit more frequently so the score is higher, but please—i'm serious—make sure it still reads like a real person wrote it. i can't have it looking like a list of buzzwords.",
